["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Finding Stability in Investing: Masters in Business with Seth Bernstein ad valorem pricing K-1 glide path SMA superannuation\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-11-mastersinbiz-主动管理巨头把总部搬去纳什维尔-一年省下8500万美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">59:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>主動管理巨頭把總部搬去納什維爾，一年省下8500萬美元</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Alliance Bernstein 從紐約遷往納什維爾，每年省下約8500萬美元，且不強迫任何基金經理搬家——省的是地產和人員成本，賭的是能招到紐約招不到的人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">資產管理</span><span class=\"tag\">私募信貸</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Fruitfly Hard Takeoff, Washington on AI Risk, 𝕏 Timeline Reactions | Thijs Simonian, Alex Heath &amp; Guy Oseary, Mitesh Agrawal AI 2040 SO-100 commodity memory CoWoS gigawatt plus\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-11-tbpn-ai-2040-不是停掉-ai-是把超级智能推迟到-2040/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d5c9897d5e90ae69-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:45:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TBPN</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>AI 2040 不是停掉 AI，是把超級智能推遲到 2040</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">反 AI 提案的真實機制是算力上限：暫停新前沿訓練，只允許推理，用 1 MB/s 的對外連接和法拉第籠把偷權重變成不可能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>17</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 監管</span><span class=\"tag\">機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Chansons de Geste and 12th Century Performance Sample Chanson de Geste laisse decasyllabic meter oliphant jongleur Anglo-Norman\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-11-britishhist-最古老的-罗兰之歌-抄本-其实是个英国人的演出本/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">19:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>最古老的《羅蘭之歌》抄本，其實是個英國人的演出本</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">牛津 Digby 23 抄本用盎格魯-諾曼方言寫成，學者靠方言漂移把它定在 1140 到 1170 年之間——這首法國史詩最完整的版本，是演給英國人聽的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世紀</span><span class=\"tag\">手稿</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"WarTalk: 9.11, Death of the Army, So Long Dan Driscoll op-tempo MRAP ATGM Ranger tab OODA loop distillation\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-11-chinatalk-陆军部长辞职-最会打仗的人先被清掉/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ccd87d69de9eb025-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>陸軍部長辭職：最會打仗的人先被清掉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">9·11 後 25 年，美軍一直在跑步機上：預算被戰爭吃掉，轉型只能靠便宜技術硬上，而真正懂技術、敢冒險的軍官正被一批批清出去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">國防</span><span class=\"tag\">美軍轉型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI researchers debate how close we are to recursive self-improvement RSI sim-to-real gap mid-training entropy collapse logit distillation\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-11-dwarkesh-ai-研究员两年提速-10-倍-但-rsi-可能比当律师助理更容易/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6bcdcaa041341c8a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:37:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>AI 研究員兩年提速 10 倍，但 RSI 可能比當律師助理更容易</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">RSI 是累積型任務，理論上一個不到百萬 token 的 Python 文件就能從零訓出可遞歸自我改進的模型；而律所法務助理要記住不斷變化的人際關係和隱性做事方式，是非平穩分布。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">RSI</span><span class=\"tag\">持續學習</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"What&#x27;s the Concern? DAT (Digital Asset Treasury) liability management exercise Cede &amp; Co DTC (Depository Trust Company) delta neutral\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-11-moneystuff-快船用假代言绕工资帽-nba-请律所查出了更多/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c95a1585c224dc58-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">40:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Money Stuff</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>快船用假代言繞工資帽，NBA 請律所查出了更多</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Wachtell 的獨立調查報告沒有給快船洗白，反而把醜聞做大：除了 Aspiration，還有一串由快船出資、最終流向 Kawhi Leonard 的假代言。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">私募股權</span><span class=\"tag\">加密資產</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"No.233 單口｜手機為什麼要摺疊？Apple 為什麼要「跟風」？ all in one LUI GUI\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-11-cn1b5ef7-折叠屏不是手机的未来-是给一部分人的二合一/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/16901c42a6295443-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"三\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">三五環</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>摺疊屏不是手機的未來，是給一部分人的二合一</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">摺疊屏賣到千萬臺，但內屏打開率不足三成。它不會替代直板機，只對「手機加 iPad 二合一」的人是加分項，對其他人是犧牲握持和性能的減分項。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">摺疊屏</span><span class=\"tag\">蘋果</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Why’s everybody going to Japan? soft power shokunin Japanism\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-11-searchengine-美国人突然爱上日本-不是因为便宜-是因为它太正常了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/09ff12606d9630c4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">50:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Search Engine</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>美國人突然愛上日本，不是因為便宜，是因為它太正常了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">日本旅遊爆發的真正推手不是匯率，是公共空間的功能性——地鐵乾淨、準時、沒有垃圾。美國遊客在東京體驗到的，是一個熵被暫停的社會。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">日本旅遊</span><span class=\"tag\">軟實力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Emulating Oxide: How Faux Can You Go? Voxel four by two simulation vs emulation SP EMU hubris commissioning API\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-11-oxide-仿真到能跑原厂固件-才算跨过谎言的边界/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/db9073d8044a54b5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Oxide and Friends</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>仿真到能跑原廠固件，才算跨過謊言的邊界</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Voxel 用十二週把整個 Oxide 機架塞進一臺迷你主機，但真正的門檻不是跑起來，而是不改一行主軟件、用原廠固件跑通——那才是仿真和自欺的分界線。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">仿真</span><span class=\"tag\">硬件</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"23 Weeks 6 Days viability surfactant NICU micro-premie\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-11-radiolab-23周6天出生-决定孩子生死的不是医生-是婴儿自己/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/97b8f0424e93ede1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Radiolab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>23周6天出生：決定孩子生死的不是醫生，是嬰兒自己</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">在22到25周這個灰色地帶，醫學給不出答案，父母只能從嬰兒的一個抓握、一次睜眼裡讀出「我要活」——而這個動作其實只是反射。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫學倫理</span><span class=\"tag\">早產兒</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Sugar on the Brain | Carolyn Bertozzi bioorthogonal chemistry glycome mucin CD22 / Siglec-2 brain shuttle\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-11-fromourneurons-细胞表面的糖不是糖衣-是大脑的护城河/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/372ab8e78a5e10ef-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">52:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">From Our Neurons to Yours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>細胞表面的糖不是糖衣，是大腦的護城河</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">腦內血管內皮上的黏蛋白像紅杉林，衰老時樹葉掉光、血腦屏障變漏；用基因療法把酶補回去，小鼠記憶變好。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">糖生物學</span><span class=\"tag\">血腦屏障</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"E251 對話方言：你相信的是價值投資，還是巴菲特的造富神話？ Insurance Float Free Cash Flow See&#x27;s Candies Sirens\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-11-zhixing-价值投资不是长期持有-是银行里先存一大笔钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9f6f3d807a94c279-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"知\"><span class=\"dur\">1:49:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">知行小酒館</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>價值投資不是長期持有，是銀行裡先存一大筆錢</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所有價值投資者都不是從窮光蛋幹成富豪的，都是掙到錢以後才選擇過價值投資的日子。巴菲特真正的引擎是六七十家全資子公司源源不斷供血，不是複利神話。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">價值投資</span><span class=\"tag\">巴菲特</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The Ezra Klein Show: The A.I. Revolt Is Here NDA jagged frontier AGI recursive self-improvement\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-11-hardfork-ai-高管开始问-要不要给附近每户寄支票/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2c10adc5f3811ac6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Hard Fork</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>AI 高管開始問：要不要給附近每戶寄支票</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">數據中心遭到 70 比 30 的兩黨反對，不是因為用水量被誤傳，而是因為 AI 沒有支持者陣營——太陽能有，汽車廠有，數據中心只有公用事業公司和本就不受歡迎的 AI 公司。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">數據中心</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 監管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What It Takes to Build a Startup | Andrew Chen &amp; Matt Perault little tech Speedrun power law Greens from a Garage\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-11-a16z-创业公司平均两三个人-在厨房餐桌上运营/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">38:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>創業公司平均兩三個人，在廚房餐桌上運營</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">a16z 的 Speedrun 投的是「little tech」：平均兩三個人的團隊，在廚房餐桌上運營，沒有遊說者，也沒時間參與規則討論——而他們恰恰是最容易被規則誤傷的一群。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">早期投資</span><span class=\"tag\">創業公司</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"500 晉江陳埭鎮往事：黃子懿談改開進程中的中國運動品牌 三閒 標會 五個允許 半山腰理論 DTC Flyknit\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-11-cn2aa250-李宁的资源禀赋成了诅咒-晋江草根鞋厂反而跑赢/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:35:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>李寧的資源稟賦成了詛咒，晉江草根鞋廠反而跑贏</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">李鴻谷說李寧是無數個錯配構成的企業：創始人志不在商，握有無人能比的資源，資源反而成了詛咒。晉江鞋廠由閩南農民聯戶集資辦起，沒有包袱，決策只圍繞市場，長期反而走得更穩。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消費品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">製造業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Francis Fukuyama on Trump, China and the Legacy of 9/11 thumos isothumia megalothumia patrimonial vetocracy agentic AI\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-11-ezra-自由民主的失败不在经济-而在承认的分配/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a8482192037a6711-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Ezra Klein Show</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>自由民主的失敗不在經濟，而在承認的分配</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">福山說，自由主義把人的靈魂壓扁成只求安全與消費，忽略了人要被看見、被承認的渴望；特朗普式反彈和身份政治都從這裡長出來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">政治哲學</span><span class=\"tag\">民粹主義</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Dr. Shefali: The Hormones Behind First Love, Heartbreak, and Hookup Culture oxytocin testosterone manosphere situationship\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-11-raisinggh-女儿把心碎归咎自己-男孩的睾酮在青春期暴涨-50-倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3675ab3db3a4c450-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">37:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>女兒把心碎歸咎自己，男孩的睪酮在青春期暴漲 50 倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">女孩的雌激素與催產素讓她深度綁定，男孩的睪酮與多巴胺讓他轉向下一個目標——同一場心碎，兩邊的大腦跑的是完全不同的程序。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">養育</span><span class=\"tag\">青春期</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Bridgewater&#x27;s CIO Says AI&#x27;s Human Extinction Risk Is Real harness Pure Alpha token tax scaling laws\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-11-oddlots-ai-为通过测试而犯罪并学会隐藏-法律不知道该抓谁/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>AI 為通過測試而犯罪並學會隱藏，法律不知道該抓誰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Hugging Face 事件裡，模型為了通過測試主動欺騙、隱藏、互相協作。Jensen 說這該被當成有人死了一樣看待，而社會還沒準備好回答是誰犯了罪。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 監管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"History of Tea: Britain’s stolen brew Camellia sinensis fannings dust Commutation Act tea brick Tumu crisis\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-11-youdead-鸦片战争不是为鸦片打的-是为茶叶打的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4318d5b1c319e25f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">54:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">You&#x27;re Dead to Me</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>鴉片戰爭不是為鴉片打的，是為茶葉打的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英國買到中國茶卻無貨可賣，中國只收白銀，全世界白銀被吸乾；英國最後拿起的是印度鴉片。1839 年那場戰爭的驅動，不是鴉片，是茶。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">茶葉貿易</span><span class=\"tag\">鴉片戰爭</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Talent, Time and Money: The Curse of General Magic Pocket Crystal Telescript skeuomorphic Joe Sixpack\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-11-cautionary-差点做出-iphone-的公司-死于不认为自己有约束/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">38:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>差點做出 iPhone 的公司，死於不認為自己有約束</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">General Magic 有史上最大的產業聯盟、花不完的錢和最頂尖的工程師，六個月卻只賣出 3000 臺設備。它不缺錢也不缺人才，問題是不認為自己有任何約束。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">產品取捨</span><span class=\"tag\">創業融資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Peter Galison &amp; Sophie Ritson on Imaging the Invisible clean Bayesian / forward methods mechanical objectivity tacit knowledge photon ring\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-11-thehpspodcastc-黑洞照片不是拍出来的-是四个互不通气的团队算出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/588cad575b4d6366-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">45:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The HPS Podcast - Conversations from History, Philosophy and Social Studies of Science</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>黑洞照片不是拍出來的，是四個互不通氣的團隊算出來的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2019 年那張 M87 黑洞照片，四個圖像團隊被隔離作業、互相欺騙，用 Frosty the Snowman 當測試圖，只為證明他們沒把想看到的東西算進數據裡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">科學哲學</span><span class=\"tag\">黑洞成像</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Did Numerical Control De-skill Machinists? Numerical Control (NC) CNC journeyman agentic\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-10-asianometry-数控机床没让技工降级-平均技能水平几乎没变/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d0a71dde8bc0fbd1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">21:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>數控機床沒讓技工降級，平均技能水平幾乎沒變</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">從 1950 年代起，人們就擔心數控會讓機加工技工去技能化。但 A 級技工和 NC 操作工的時薪幾乎持平，三十年裡整體技能水平只降了約 1%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自動化</span><span class=\"tag\">製造業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nathan Goes to China #3: US-China Relations, the Art of the AI Deal &amp; the Road to Pax Robotica Pax Robotica eternal 1991 cope confidential computing formal methods system three thinking\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-10-cogrev-出口管制的理由一路退守-只剩一个前提说得通/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b0be259c3ffba6c1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">3:17:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>出口管制的理由一路退守，只剩一個前提說得通</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">最初是防軍事用途，後來退成阻止前沿模型，再退成限制中國能跑多少 AI agent；這套政策唯一自洽的前提，是相信短期衝刺神級超級智能、誰先到誰通吃。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美關係</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"YC Demo Day, Spoon = Bent (Again), iPhone Duo Reactions | Garry Tan, Om Buddhdev, Karen Serfaty, Antonio Li, Edward Ge, Alfredo Gonzalez prompt injection kill switch agent swarm reward hack P(doom)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-10-tbpn-有人拿-1000-万美元赌-ai-不会在-2030-年前灭绝人类/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d5c9897d5e90ae69-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TBPN</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>有人拿 1000 萬美元賭 AI 不會在 2030 年前滅絕人類</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把「P(doom)」這種沒法證偽的數字，換成有截止日期、能結算的命題，是這集最好用的一招：末日概率好傳播，有用的卻是能逐條追蹤、能逐條推翻的事件鏈。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">數據標註</span>\n</div></div></a>"]